---
layout: base.njk
title: Best of
pagination:
  data: collections.mediumBestPages
  size: 1
  alias: medium
  addAllPagesToCollections: false
navView: best
permalink: "{{ medium.urls.best }}"
---
{#- One per medium (2026-10-25). A featured essay counts for its own medium;
    a featured daily for every medium its ## headings file to. -#}
{%- set picks = medium.featured %}
<h1>Best of</h1>
<p class="tag-desc">These are the ones I like, either as places to start or because I'm proud of them, or because they meant something to me.</p>

<ul class="archive-list">
  {% for post in picks %}
  <li>
    <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title or (post.date | readableDate) }}</a>
    {% if post.data.title %}<span class="archive-note">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</span>{% endif %}
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
